  "data": {
    "document": "Core Rules",
    "section": "07. The Battle Round",
    "ruleNumber": "07.02",
    "summary": "The mission names the player who goes first in every round. Each player takes one turn, bounded by start and end steps. Command, Movement, Shooting, Charge and Fight come between them. At turn end, resolve ordinary effects before checking mission triggers. Permission to act outside the usual sequence does not enable other phase-locked rules. A trigger that names no player’s turn or phase applies to both players’ occurrences.",
